{"id":"vod_sn_37014","vodId":"37014","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"吹响悠风号","name_cn":"吹响悠风号","date":"2015-01-01","year":"2015","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/c3431e07ef4bae3e3b3a48f81d5e3905.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生北宇治高中，黄前久美子（黑泽知叶 配音）刚刚踏入校园，对于未知的高中生活，久美子充满了憧憬。加藤叶月（朝井彩加 配音）是久美子的同级生，在叶月的极力劝说之下，耳根软的久美子在半推半就之下加入了学校的吹奏乐部。曾经，吹奏乐部有着十分辉煌的历史，然而，在换了顾问之后，吹奏乐部渐渐落寞，如今，音乐老师泷升（樱井孝宏 配音）作为新的顾问新鲜赴任，他对重振吹奏乐部，进军全国大会有着极大的信心。　　个性乐观开朗的川岛绿辉（丰田萌绘 配音）、理智冷静的高坂丽奈（安济知佳 配音）、大姐头田中明日香（寿美菜子 配音），在这些前辈们的陪伴和指导之下，久美子快乐的高中生活就此拉开序幕。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:48:03","playable":true,"episodeCount":14,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/cPNRBNPdyG1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/C3mpaqmQCi1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/pVmm4kiFFP1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/f7FvC665MY1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/BufSL3fEN51/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/PAVL7jjUzW1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/wpZgcSUNRn1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/GjdsXyNXn01/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/VgZCtz0r7V1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ubeDEKzb3J1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/rw68vt9D2v1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/2rSb3k0cVp1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/utPHxs8Vfd1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/gpdSXTDaFD1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapsho